以下是使用 `array_sort` 函数對每個列表進行升序和降序排序的調用示例（每個列表都會產生兩次調用，一次升序一次降序）：

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[45,12,67,21,89],"order":"ascending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[45,12,67,21,89],"order":"descending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[34,78,12,56,90],"order":"ascending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[34,78,12,56,90],"order":"descending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[23,45,67,89,12],"order":"ascending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[23,45,67,89,12],"order":"descending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[56,78,90,12,34],"order":"ascending"}}
```

```json
{"name":"array_sort","arguments":{"list":[56,78,90,12,34],"order":"descending"}}
```

執行上述調用後，你將得到每個列表的升序和降序排列結果。
